      "id": "claim_91d3e9dd5a7d4bbe842a1c81d24b6864",
      "statement": "@chrysalyst/web is the driving adapter: it speaks only to the HTTP API on loopback, declares no workspace package, imports no domain module, and the App shell mounts InterviewView with the API client and the chrome's language as props so tests drive the view without a network or a real browser language.",
